  <doc name="planning">
    <heading level="1">Project Planning</heading>
    <p>Core idea: reading tracker and social media, 'Goodreads crossed with Reddit'.</p>
    <heading level="2">Semantic Layer</heading>
    <p>This is what I think could become the 'secret sauce' for this project. Consider a book, a chapter, an author, or a book series as possible 'objects'. By tying a room (forum/channel) to an object, we structure conversation around the topic. By using the structure of the objects, we can compose structure in the rooms.</p>
